g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, III, and IV.\"</p>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
